<title>TAIWAN: Hua Nan approves 1995/96 dividend issue.</title>
<headline>Hua Nan approves 1995/96 dividend issue.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's state-run Hua Nan Commercial bank on Tuesday approved a stock dividend of T$2 per share, or 200 shares for every 1,000 shares, for the year ending June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>The bank would also issue a cash dividend of T$1 per share, a company statement said.</p>
<p>The board also decided to boost the bank's capitalisation by T$4.267 billion to T$25.605 billion, it said.</p>
<p>The decision requires final approval from a shareholders' meeting scheduled for November 16.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
